ATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0002> is the morphism of\ncategories cofibered in groupoids over <MATH_0008> defined by the\nrules\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0009> maps to the object <MATH_0010>, and\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012> give rise to the morphism\n<MATH_0013> lying over\n<MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n<STRUCT_0008>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3aff60fc8370146c548fc73c0bc078f55afc5c974c9864e184961ff0f971ccfb", "unit_id": "tag:06KB:statement"}
